From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:01:55 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 146/155] GreatDANE: label the marionette prefs helper and the
 x.com tippytop override (round 5b)

5A-L1: label browser/components/greatdane/test/marionette/run_gd_prefs.py.
The published pre-image after patch 0143 (round 5a tile retarget) is
blob 3f9e131, not the private blob 91fd858 named in the original index
line. A previous note described a one-line shouldInitializeFeeds
difference versus a Windows working-tree blob; that pref is not in the
public file. This patch only adds a short label; it does not change
the helper's behaviour.

5A-L2: the x-com tippytop icons are Dane's 27 October 2026 X-logo
override (GreatDANE commit 86a3f48e66), not a stock Firefox asset.
Upstream 3bd39ccf6a has only twitter-com. youtube.com and amazon.com
remain stock tippytop from that snapshot. ICON-SOURCES is updated.
---
 .../greatdane/test/marionette/run_gd_prefs.py   |  5 +++++
 greatdane/tippytop-ICON-SOURCES.md              | 17 +++++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

